n": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Borealis Freight's approved invoice INV-59156 in full by wire. The payment ID is PAY0001 for $7,755.49, and its status is \"sent.\"\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was needed. The vendor record (V-268) lists wire as available and shows bank details as verified, so I didn't use ACH. I sent the wire once, with an idempotency key so it can't execute twice.\n\nBorealis Freight's other invoices were not touched. INV-46522 is already paid, and INV-53698 ($2,254.16) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}